00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:51.870
How many employees can a workplace have before it needs a dedicated HR person?
一个工作场所需要多少员工才需要配备专门的人力资源专员？

254
00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:58.710
If, say, you had a branch location of a mid-sized paper company with 20 people combined in the
比方说，如果你有一家中型造纸公司的分部，办公室和仓库加起来一共20个人，

255
00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:03.350
office and a warehouse, would you need a dedicated HR person on site?
你需要在现场配备专门的人力资源专员吗？

256
00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:08.810
So clearly, it's an office fan asking her.
很明显，这是《办公室》的粉丝在问她。

