00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:58.490
And I'm going to sprinkle them throughout the episode.
我打算把它们穿插在这一集里。

291
00:12:58.810 --> 00:12:59.150
Oh, great.
哦，太棒了。

292
00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:02.150
And he also shared with me some of his very first outlines.
他还和我分享了他最初的一些大纲。

293
00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:06.350
And there was a Pam storyline that he had in his outline that didn't make it.
大纲里有一个帕姆的故事线没能用上。

294
00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.630
And I want to share that with you, too.
我也想和你们分享一下。

295
00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.170
This is going to be a good episode.
这一集会很精彩。

296
00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:09.550
Yeah.
是啊。

297
00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:10.230
All right.
好的。

