00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.460
is no longer with us.
已经不在我们身边了。

302
00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.800
And everyone was like, what happened?
大家都问，到底发生了什么？

303
00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:32.680
And Andy's like, no, no.
安迪就说，不，不是那样的。

304
00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.700
Well, he took the job in Florida.
他去佛罗里达接了份工作。

305
00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:35.760
He's going to be the VP.
他要去当副总裁了。

306
00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:39.460
And Angela's like, you implied that something horrible had happened to him.
安吉拉就说，你刚才暗示他出了什么可怕的事。

307
00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:42.200
And he goes, yes, he had a stroke.
他说，没错，他中风了。

308
00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:44.040
A massive stroke.
严重中风。

309
00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:44.960
Of good luck.
好运中风。

310
00:13:45.120 --> 00:13:45.480
Yes.
是的。

311
