And now he's in a better place.
现在他去了个更好的地方。

312
00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:53.740
Well, this makes everyone wonder if they can open up his treasure.
好吧，这让大家都很好奇能不能打开他的宝藏。

313
00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:54.660
Yeah.
是啊。

314
00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.340
